wyvern~
the wyvern~
A monstrous wyvern slowly circles just above your head, its breath steaming in the cold air.
~
This huge winged creature looks really menacing.  A dusting of snow coats its
scales -- proof it has been roosting somewhere up in the frozen peaks.  You
are happy it doesn't APPEAR to be very hungry ... yet.
~
