#3574
The Woodsman Inn~
    You are in the common room of the Woodsman Inn. Evergreen boughs have
been draped along the rafters and a pair of red candles burn on the bar,
filling the room with a warm pine scent. A thin haze of wood smoke sits in
the air. The bard is attempting a winter carol in the corner. You can go
north to the bar or south for a quieter table.
~
