#3576
The Bar~
     This is where people use to come and enjoy the food and hospitality
of the innkeeper. These days he only serves the hardy few. Sprigs of pine
and holly have been tucked behind the bottles behind the bar, and a pot of
spiced cider sits warming by the fire. You can leave south to the common room.
